{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15206370","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15206370","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1520637001:1":{"text":"매튜가 이런 꼴이 됐다니... 에휴.","source_cn":"马修这副样子……唉。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x46B18D19F1F44323","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1520637002:1":{"text":"군의관을 불러오지. 조금만 기다리도록.","source_cn":"我去找军医来帮他治疗一下，请稍等。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB2533AFD0C282BFA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:4:1520637003:0":{"text":"정신을 맑게 해주는 포션을 마신 뒤, 매튜는 더 이상 퀴리의 이름을 부르지 않고 조용히 앉아만 있었다","source_cn":"在服用过令人清醒的药剂后，马修不再念叨奎莉的名字，只是...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x96EFEEC037909EEB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1520637004:1":{"text":"여전히 미친 사람처럼 뭘 물어봐도 전혀 대답하지 않아.","source_cn":"他还是这样疯疯癫癫的，无论我们问什么都不回答。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5DB90ACAA7116CF1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1520637005:1":{"text":"매튜의 저런 모습을 보니 퀴리를 볼 면목이 없군...","source_cn":"看到他这副样子，我都感觉对不起奎莉……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCB2B6FBC56D697DB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:8:1520637005":{"text":"매튜의 저런 모습을 보니 퀴리를 볼 면목이 없군...","source_cn":"看到他这副样子，我都感觉对不起奎莉……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCB2B6FBC56D697DB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1520637006:0":{"text":"알아. 하지만 전우의 아버지가 저러는 것을 보니...","source_cn":"我当然知道，但看到战友的父亲这样……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x80984CC0CCDBF937","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1520637007:0":{"text":"내가 저런 상황이 되면 어떻게 될지 상상조차 하고 싶지 않군.","source_cn":"我不敢想象如果我面临和他一样的遭遇，那会是什么样。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x526E705EAA8A86D9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1520637009:0":{"text":"...여기 없네, 없어... 그러면... 한 번 더...","source_cn":"……不在这里，不在这里……我想要……再一次……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3CA0D4DBE994CA63","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1520637010:0":{"text":"주름꽃 우산을 그렇게 많이 먹었으니 거기에 환각 효과가 있다는 걸 알고 있었겠죠.","source_cn":"你吃了那么多弥纹花伞，肯定知道它能致幻。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3808EB83FEA07890","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1520637011:1":